   A Grayspeak Textbook
   ​[italic]By Taikondy Roga Numbytoo[/italic]
   ………………………………………………………………………………

   Oum!

   As part of NanoTrasen's Operation: Sensibility, this textbook is your first step into the world of the language frequently referred to as “Grayspeak.”

   Learning and understanding a foreign language is by no means an easy task! Grayspeak is no exception. So please understand that no one gets anything right their first try. Fluency is a long battle. Patience and never losing hope will be your greatest weapons.

   Never give up! Try your best! Never hesitate to ask questions!

   ………………………………………………………………………………

